{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53919","headline":"简知举陈商（题拟） · 高元裕","name":"简知举陈商（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中丞爲国拔英（《全唐诗》作「贤」）才，寒畯（《全唐诗》作「俊」）欣逢藻监开。\n九朶莲花秋浦隔，两枝丹桂一时开。\n（《登科记考》卷二二引《永乐大典》引《秋浦新志》。\n此诗承汤华泉同志录示。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七九五仅存此诗之前二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高元裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}